// DRAGONFIRE PROTECTION, AS A PROPERTY OF THE SHIELD rather than as its name.
//
// Eleven places across six files used to ask `inv_total(worn, antidragonbreathshield) > 0`: the
// generic dragon attack, the King Black Dragon's four branches, Elvarg, the skeletal wyvern and
// the bolt effects' immunity test. Every one of them is a list of one item that nobody would think
// to extend, and the first thing that needed extending - a dragonfire shield - would have been the
// best shield in the game and would have set its owner on fire.
//
// So the question moved onto the item. ~has_antidragon_shield reads this param off whatever is in
// the hand slot, and anything that protects against dragonfire says so here: the anti-dragon
// shield in all.obj, both dragonfire shields, and whatever comes next.
[antidragon]
type=boolean
default=no
